      "origin": {
        "eyebrow": "OUR STORY",
        "title": "Born from a spreadsheet, a rainy Sunday, and a lost rental weekend.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "In 2023, Anaïs managed a marina of 18 sailboats in Marseille. Maintenance lived in a shared Excel, binders at the yard, and Yann the mechanic's memory.",
          "One Saturday in June, a client discovered at departure that his sailboat's battery was flat. It was noted somewhere. Weekend cancelled. Negative margin. Forced smile.",
          "On Sunday, she called Théo (ex-Doctolib, sailor). Three months later, FleetAi had its first client: her own marina.",
          "Today, 40+ fleets across France use FleetAi. We've never strayed far from the dock."
        ],
